"Report saved – reachable from the settings under “Open the hardware reports”"
msgstr ""
"Bericht abgelegt – zu finden über die Einstellungen unter „Hardware-Berichte "
"öffnen“"

#: applet.js:1168
msgid ""
"Sensors, interfaces or drives have appeared or gone – the lists are up to "
